      "content": "uhm okay but i'm kinda broke right now and the clinic is so far away... do u think it's really that serious? it's just a tiny red line and it doesn't even hurt that bad, just feels a bit weird. maybe if i just take some ibuprofen and keep the ointment on it for another day it'll clear up?",
